WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.518
Lesson 5: Case maths without the panic

2
00:00:03.668 --> 00:00:11.829
The arithmetic is simple; doing it out loud under pressure is not. Approach first, round smartly, sanity-check everything.

3
00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:13.552
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:17.125
State the formula and get agreement before calculating.

5
00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:21.056
Talk while you work; sanity-check the size of every answer.

6
00:00:21.256 --> 00:00:24.837
Finish every calculation with what it means for the client.

7
00:00:25.037 --> 00:00:29.777
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
